# - resource -------------------------------------------------------------------

<https://hsa.inera.se/fhir/CapabilityStatement/hsa-client-1177-hitta-vard> a fhir:CapabilityStatement ;
  fhir:nodeRole fhir:treeRoot ;
  fhir:id [ fhir:v "hsa-client-1177-hitta-vard"] ; # 
  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Genererad berättande text: CapabilityStatement hsa-client-1177-hitta-vard</b></p><a name=\"hsa-client-1177-hitta-vard\"> </a><a name=\"hchsa-client-1177-hitta-vard\"> </a><h2 id=\"title\">HSA Klient – 1177 Hitta vård</h2><ul><li>Implementationsguidens version: 0.1.0 </li><li>FHIR-version: 5.0.0 </li><li>Format som stöds: <code>json</code></li><li>Publicerad: 2026-05-21 </li><li>Publicerad av: Inera AB / HSA-IG projekt </li></ul><blockquote class=\"impl-note\"><p><strong>Notera till implementörer: FHIR-förmågor</strong></p><p>Vilken FHIR-förmåga som helst kan vara 'tillåten' av systemet om den inte uttryckligen är markerad som 'SHALL NOT'. Några objekt är markerade som MAY i implementationsguiden för att belysa deras potentiella relevans för användningsfallet.</p></blockquote><h2 id=\"rest\">FHIR RESTful-förmågor</h2><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h3 id=\"mode1\" class=\"panel-title\">Mode: <code>client</code></h3></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div><p>1177 Hitta vård använder följande frågemönster:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Geo-sökning: GET /Location?near=[lat]|[lon]|[radius]|km&amp;_security=...03\nmed _revinclude=HealthcareService:location&amp;_revinclude=Organization:organization</li>\n<li>Namnssökning: GET /Organization?name=[prefix]&amp;hsa-org-class=healthcare-unit&amp;_security=...03</li>\n<li>Hämta detaljer: GET /Organization/[id] + separata anrop för Location och HealthcareService\nAlla anrop filtreras på _security=urn:oid:1.2.752.29.23.1.11|03 (publika resurser).</li>\n</ol>\n</div></div></div><h3 id=\"resourcesCap1\">Förmågor per resurs/profil</h3><h4 id=\"resourcesSummary1\">Sammanfattning</h4><p>Sammanfattningstabellen listar resurserna som ingår i denna konfiguration, och för varje resurs listar den:</p><ul><li>De relevanta profilerna (om några)</li><li>Interaktionerna som stöds av varje resurs (<b><span class=\"bg-info\">R</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">S</span></b>earch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">U</span></b>pdate, and <b><span class=\"bg-info\">C</span></b>reate, are always shown, while <b><span class=\"bg-info\">VR</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">P</span></b>atch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">D</span></b>elete, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">I</span></b>nstance, or <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">T</span></b>yp är endast närvarande om minst en av resurserna har stöd för dem.</li><li><span>De obligatoriska, rekommenderade och vissa valfria sökparametrarna (om några). </span></li><li>De länkade resurserna aktiverade för <code>_include</code></li><li>De övriga resurserna aktiverade för <code>_revinclude</code></li><li>Operationerna på resursen (om några)</li></ul><div class=\"table-responsive\"><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th><b>Resurstyp</b></th><th><b>Profil</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET en resurs (läs-interaktion)\">R</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET alla resurser av typen (sök-interaktion)\">S</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"PUT en ny resursversion (uppdatera-interaktion)\">U</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"POST en ny resurs (skapa-interaktion)\">C</b></th><th><b title=\"Obligatoriska och rekommenderade sökparametrar\">Sökningar</b></th><th><code><b>_include</b></code></th><th><code><b>_revinclude</b></code></th><th><b>Operationer</b></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#Organization1-1\">Organization</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-hsa-catalog-organization.html\">https://hsa.inera.se/fhir/StructureDefinition/hsa-catalog-organization</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>_security, name, active, hsa-org-class, partof</td><td><code>Organization:partof</code></td><td><code>Location:organization</code>, <code>HealthcareService:organization</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Location1-2\">Location</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-hsa-catalog-location.html\">https://hsa.inera.se/fhir/StructureDefinition/hsa-catalog-location</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>_security, near, organization</td><td><code>Location:organization</code></td><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#HealthcareService1-3\">HealthcareService</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-hsa-healthcare-service.html\">https://hsa.inera.se/fhir/StructureDefinition/hsa-healthcare-service</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>_security, organization, service-category</td><td><code>HealthcareService:organization</code>, <code>HealthcareService:location</code></td><td/><td/></tr></tbody></table></div><hr/><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"Organization1-1\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resurskonformans: unspecified </span>Organization</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Bassystemprofil</span><br/><a href=\"StructureDefinition-hsa-catalog-organization.html\">HSA Catalog Organization</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Profilkonformans</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Referenspolicy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaktionssammanfattning</span><br/><ul><li>Stöder <code>read</code>, <code>search-type</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12\"><span class=\"lead\">Dokumentation</span><blockquote><div><p>Hämtar och visar vårdgivare/vårdenheter. Relevanta fält: name, type, active, contact.telecom, contact.address, meta.security.</p>\n</div></blockquote></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\"><span class=\"lead\">Sökparametrar</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Konformans</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Typ</th><th>Dokumentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>_security</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>name</td><td><code>string</code></td><td><div><p>Namnssökning för fritextsök i 1177.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>active</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"SearchParameter-hsa-org-class.html\">hsa-org-class</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Filtrera på healthcare-unit för vårdenhetssökning.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>partof</td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div/></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"col-lg-5\"> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"Location1-2\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resurskonformans: unspecified </span>Location</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Bassystemprofil</span><br/><a href=\"StructureDefinition-hsa-catalog-location.html\">HSA Catalog Location</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Profilkonformans</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Referenspolicy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaktionssammanfattning</span><br/><ul><li>Stöder <code>read</code>, <code>search-type</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12\"><span class=\"lead\">Dokumentation</span><blockquote><div><p>Geo-sökning och kartvisning. Använder position (SWEREF99), address (fysisk, utan postnummer), description (vägbeskrivning).</p>\n</div></blockquote></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\"><span class=\"lead\">Sökparametrar</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Konformans</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Typ</th><th>Dokumentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>_security</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>near</td><td><code>special</code></td><td><div><p>Geo-sökning är primärt frågemönster för kartvisning.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>organization</td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div/></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"col-lg-5\"> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"HealthcareService1-3\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resurskonformans: unspecified </span>HealthcareService</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Bassystemprofil</span><br/><a href=\"StructureDefinition-hsa-healthcare-service.html\">HSA Healthcare Service</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Profilkonformans</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Referenspolicy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaktionssammanfattning</span><br/><ul><li>Stöder <code>read</code>, <code>search-type</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12\"><span class=\"lead\">Dokumentation</span><blockquote><div><p>Öppettider, verksamhetskod och VPW-texter (Om oss, information till patient, tillfällig info). Använder availability, category[verksamhetskod], comment, extension[temporaryNotice], extension[patientInfo].</p>\n</div></blockquote></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\"><span class=\"lead\">Sökparametrar</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Konformans</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Typ</th><th>Dokumentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>_security</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>organization</td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>service-category</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Filtrera på verksamhetskod (OID 1.2.752.129.2.2.1.3).</p>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"col-lg-5\"> </div></div></div></div></div></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
  ] ; # 
